. * Run DID Models 1, 3 and 5 of DID_Regs.do, we flag with e(sample), meaning t
> his creates a row with 1's and 0's and the 1's are the observations used in t
> he regression. Then later on in the script we will count these ones to get th
> e sample of treated or control. 
. * Purpose of this block is to find out exactly which children each regression
>  uses
. local cnt_did_controls "drought2005_post drought2006_post drought2007_post dr
> ought2008_post"

. local cnt_controls02 "dwell_electricity_02_post dwell_floor_good_02_post dwel
